      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "As noted [in other closed Feedback posts](https://vrchat.canny.io/avatar-30/p/bug-sdk-breaks-when-using-an-overridecontroller-on-gesture-layer) and in the [documentation](https://docs.vrchat.com/v2020.2.3-av3/docs/avatars-30#playable-layers), we do not support using any other type of controller in Playable layers-- only Animation Controllers.",
