      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Is this a technical limitation or design decision?  Using overrides instead of inserting individual clips into a duplicate animator for every avatar would save a LOT of time and would be simpler for newcomers.",
